#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Integration check for the gateway's LiteLLM adapter (design SL-011 sec-6,
P2; SL-014 sec-6), run by checks.<system>.llm-gateway against the LiteLLM the
system nixpkgs ships. Offline: the proxy app is driven in-process (no
socket), and every model of the test config answers from its
`mock_response`. The fake-backed tests run a second app, on the fake config,
in a child process: its models call a fake OpenRouter on loopback. Keys live
in a temp store, shared by both apps. Provider keys are dummies.

Environment, set by the check:
  LLM_GATEWAY_SERVE         the launcher, llm-gateway-serve, PROVIDERS baked
  LLM_GATEWAY_TEST_CONFIG   config dir: production mapping + mock_response + `unpriced`
  LLM_GATEWAY_CONFIG        config dir: the production mapping, as served
  LLM_GATEWAY_FAKE_CONFIG   config dir: models served by the fake OpenRouter
  LLM_GATEWAY_FAKE_PORT     the loopback port the fake config names
  LLM_GATEWAY_REPORTS_COST  JSON list: the variables of cost-reporting providers
plus LiteLLM's offline settings (see perSystem.nix).

One process, one app: the proxy's state is module-global.
"""

